<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>OrbitFlow · 更清晰的团队协作</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.bunny.net"><link href="https://fonts.bunny.net/css?family=inter:400,500,600,700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
@vite(['resources/css/app.css', 'resources/js/app.js']) @fluxAppearance @livewireStyles
</head>
<body class="bg-[#fafaff] text-zinc-900 antialiased dark:bg-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-100">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
        <nav class="flex h-24 items-center justify-between border-b border-zinc-200/80 dark:border-zinc-800">
            <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-3 font-bold"><span class="flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-sm font-black text-white">OF</span> <span class="text-lg tracking-tight">OrbitFlow</span></a>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4"><a href="#features" class="hidden text-sm text-zinc-500 hover:text-indigo-600 sm:block">产品功能</a><a href="#pricing" class="hidden text-sm text-zinc-500 hover:text-indigo-600 sm:block">方案说明</a><a href="{{ route('login') }}" class="text-sm font-medium">登录</a><flux:button :href="route('register')" variant="primary">免费开始</flux:button></div>
        </nav>
        <main>
            <section class="relative flex flex-col items-center pb-20 pt-24 text-center md:pt-32">
                <div class="absolute -z-10 top-7 h-[430px] w-[600px] max-w-full rounded-full bg-indigo-200/40 blur-[110px] dark:bg-indigo-800/20"></div>
                <span class="rounded-full border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-700 dark:border-indigo-800 dark:bg-indigo-950 dark:text-indigo-200">为小型团队打造的专注协作空间</span>
                <h1 class="mt-8 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.18] tracking-[-.05em] md:text-[74px]">让每一个项目，<br><span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 to-violet-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">都向着目标前进。</span></h1>
                <p class="mt-7 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-zinc-500 md:text-lg">项目规划、任务跟踪、团队协作和工作区管理，所有重要事项集中在一个优雅的 SaaS 工作台。</p>
                <div class="mt-9 flex items-center gap-3"><flux:button :href="route('register')" variant="primary" icon:trailing="arrow-right">创建免费账户</flux:button><flux:button :href="route('login')">进入工作台</flux:button></div>
            </section>
            <section class="mb-24 overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-[0_32px_100px_-38px_rgba(79,70,229,.24)] dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900">
                <div class="flex h-9 items-center gap-2 border-b border-zinc-100 px-3 dark:border-zinc-800"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-300"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-300"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-300"></span><span class="ml-auto text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">Workspace preview</span></div>
                <div class="grid min-h-[340px] grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[200px_1fr]"><div class="hidden border-r border-zinc-100 bg-zinc-50/70 p-6 dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-950 md:block"><p class="text-sm font-bold">OrbitFlow</p><div class="mt-10 space-y-5 text-sm"><p class="rounded-lg bg-indigo-100 px-3 py-2 font-semibold text-indigo-700">◫ 概览</p><p class="px-3 text-zinc-500">▤ 项目管理</p><p class="px-3 text-zinc-500">♧ 团队成员</p><p class="px-3 text-zinc-500">⚙ 设置</p></div></div><div class="space-y-7 p-7 md:p-10"><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-indigo-600">团队工作台</p><h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold">项目概览</h2><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-400">看清正在推进的每一步。</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 md:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-4 dark:border-zinc-700"><p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">全部项目</p><p class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold">12</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-4 dark:border-zinc-700"><p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">进行中</p><p class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold">08</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-4 dark:border-zinc-700"><p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">总任务</p><p class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold">64</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-4 dark:border-zinc-700"><p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">已完成</p><p class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold">41</p></div></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 p-5 text-left dark:border-zinc-700"><div class="mb-5 flex justify-between text-sm font-semibold"><span>最近项目</span><span class="text-indigo-600">查看全部</span></div><div class="space-y-4 text-sm"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>产品官网改版</span><span class="rounded-full bg-green-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-green-700">进行中</span></div><div class="h-px bg-zinc-100 dark:bg-zinc-800"></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span>移动端设计系统</span><span class="rounded-full bg-amber-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-amber-700">规划中</span></div></div></div></div></div>
            </section>
            <section id="features" class="pb-24"><p class="section-kicker text-center">WHAT'S INSIDE</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-center text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">为专注协作而设计</h2><div class="mt-11 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="surface p-7"><span class="text-3xl">◫</span><h3 class="mt-7 font-semibold">项目管理</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-500">统一管理项目状态、说明和交付日期，保持工作可见。</p></div><div class="surface p-7"><span class="text-3xl">▤</span><h3 class="mt-7 font-semibold">任务协作</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-500">为成员分配任务，设置优先级并跟踪执行进度。</p></div><div class="surface p-7"><span class="text-3xl">♧</span><h3 class="mt-7 font-semibold">多工作区</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-500">将不同团队和项目空间隔离，清楚划分数据与成员权限。</p></div></div></section>
            <section id="pricing" class="mb-24 rounded-3xl bg-[#1d2450] px-7 py-12 text-center text-white md:py-16"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-indigo-300">MVP EDITION</p><h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold">从一个免费工作区开始</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-indigo-200">当前为功能演示型 SaaS MVP：可注册、创建工作区和项目，但尚未连接在线收款及商业订阅。</p><div class="mt-7"><flux:button :href="route('register')" variant="primary" color="indigo">立即创建账户</flux:button></div></section>
        </main>
        <footer class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-zinc-200 py-8 text-xs text-zinc-400 dark:border-zinc-800 sm:flex-row"><span>© {{ date('Y') }} OrbitFlow</span><span>Laravel · Livewire · Flux UI · Tailwind CSS</span></footer>
    </div>
    @livewireScripts @fluxScripts
